#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA = clean edges at the game's render size. DLSS = the same, and it upscales when the game's "
"Scaling is below 100 %. Mix = the game's own TAA blended with DLAA / DLSS: calmer, a bit softer. "
"off = the game's own picture. Saved at once."
msgstr ""
"DLAA = vores nets a la mida de renderitzat del joc. DLSS = el mateix, i escala cap amunt quan "
"l'Escalat del joc és inferior al 100 %. Mescla = el TAA propi del joc barrejat amb DLAA / DLSS: "
"més calmat, una mica més suau. off = la imatge del joc. Es desa a l'instant."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How much of the Mix is the game's TAA, 0 - 100 % in 10 % steps: more = calmer and softer, less = "
"sharper. Shown while Mode is Mix, or a split has a Mix side. No extra cost."
msgstr ""
"Quant de la mescla és el TAA del joc, 0 - 100 % en passos del 10 %: més = més calmat i suau, "
"menys = més nítid. Es mostra mentre el Mode és Mescla, o una divisió té un costat de mescla. "
"Sense cost addicional."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Presets for your graphics card. high = everything on (model 1). medium = model 2, a lighter Glass "
"and fence fix, mirrors without Track moving parts. low = also no Smooth mirrors, no Glass and "
"fence fix, VR area 60 %. Never changes a setting you set yourself."
msgstr ""
"Perfils per a la teva targeta gràfica. high = tot activat (model 1). medium = model 2, un "
"arranjament de vidres i tanques més lleuger, retrovisors sense Seguir peces mòbils. low = a més "
"sense Retrovisors suaus, sense arranjament de vidres i tanques, àrea VR 60 %. Mai canvia un ajust "
"que hagis posat tu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"1 (K) = most detail, sharpest text, about 1.6x the GPU of 2. 2 (E) = balanced, fewest trails "
"behind traffic: start here. 3 (F) = calmest on fences and wires, can smear moving detail, same "
"cost as 2. 4 (M) = heaviest (about 5x), flat tests only."
msgstr ""
"1 (K) = més detall, text més nítid, uns 1,6 cops la GPU del 2. 2 (E) = equilibrat, menys rastres "
"darrere el trànsit: comença aquí. 3 (F) = el més tranquil en tanques i cables, pot esborrar "
"detalls en moviment, mateix cost que el 2. 4 (M) = el més pesat (uns 5 cops), només proves en pla."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Picture quality: sharpening, texture sharpness, the Glass and fence fix, the Light trail fix and "
"the DLAA area. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Qualitat d'imatge: nitidesa, nitidesa de textura, arranjament de vidres i tanques, arranjament de "
"rastres de llum i l'àrea DLAA. Dreta obre el grup, Esquerra el tanca; comença tancat cada cop que "
"s'obre el menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharpens the picture after DLAA, 0 (off) to 1.0. Raise it if the picture looks soft; too high "
"gives bright halos on edges. Costs about 0.1 ms; 0 skips the pass."
msgstr ""
"Augmenta la nitidesa després del DLAA, de 0 (desactivat) a 1,0. Puja-la si la imatge es veu suau; "
"massa alt fa halos clars a les vores. Costa uns 0,1 ms; 0 se salta el pas."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far the sharpening reaches, 1 to 4 px: small = fine detail, large = bolder edges. Change it "
"if the sharpening looks too fine or too coarse; a picture drawn larger than the screen, as in VR, "
"needs more than 1 px."
msgstr ""
"Abast de la nitidesa, d'1 a 4 px: petit = detall fi, gran = vores més marcades. Canvia-ho si la "
"nitidesa sembla massa fina o gruixuda; una imatge més gran que la pantalla, com en VR, necessita "
"més d'1 px."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharper texture text (road signs, dashboard, GPS). 0 = off; more negative = sharper but more "
"shimmer on fences; try -0.5 to -1 if text is blurry. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Text de textura més nítid (senyals, tauler, GPS). 0 = desactivat; més negatiu = més nítid però "
"més parpelleig a les tanques; prova de -0,5 a -1 si el text es veu borrós. Gairebé sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The same for wire fences, grass and leaves: raise it toward 0 if fences shimmer, lower it if "
"grass looks soft. same = follows the row above. Works only while Texture sharpness is not 0. "
"Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"El mateix per a tanques de filferro, herba i fulles: puja cap a 0 si les tanques parpellegen, "
"baixa si l'herba es veu tova. igual = segueix la fila de dalt. Només funciona si Nitidesa de "
"textura no és 0. Gairebé sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Wires, fences and windows are treated as the thing in front, not as what you see through them, so "
"they do not smear when you move. Turn it off if you see no smearing there: saves 0.02 - 0.06 ms "
"per eye."
msgstr ""
"Cables, tanques i vidres es tracten com allò que és al davant, no com allò que es veu a través, "
"perquè no s'esborrin en moure't. Desactiva-ho si no veus esborrat: estalvia 0,02 - 0,06 ms per "
"ull."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Stops street-lamp and car-light glows leaving a trail behind them when you move: the glows are "
"drawn fresh each frame instead of being blended with older frames. 25 % steps; lower it if lamp "
"glows flicker, 0 = off. Costs about 0.05 - 0.2 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Evita que els resplendors de fanals i llums de cotxe deixin rastre en moure't: els resplendors es "
"dibuixen de nou a cada fotograma en lloc de barrejar-se amb els anteriors. Passos del 25 %; "
"baixa-ho si els resplendors parpellegen, 0 = desactivat. Costa uns 0,05 - 0,2 ms per ull."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR: only the middle of each eye gets DLAA (20 to 100 %); the edge keeps the game's picture. Lower "
"it to afford a heavier model or win frame rate; 40 % costs about 40 % of the model. Also sets the "
"garage / main-menu truck."
msgstr ""
"VR: només el centre de cada ull rep DLAA (20 a 100 %); la vora conserva la imatge del joc. "
"Baixa-ho per permetre't un model més pesat o guanyar fps; 40 % costa uns 40 % del model. També "
"fixa el camió del garatge / menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How moving parts and truck mirrors are handled by DLAA. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it "
"starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Com el DLAA tracta les peces en moviment i els retrovisors del camió. Dreta obre el grup, "
"Esquerra el tanca; comença tancat cada cop que s'obre el menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA follows each moving thing on its own (traffic, wheels, number plates), so it stays sharp and "
"leaves no trail. Turn it off only to save about 0.5 ms per eye or to test: everything then moves "
"with the camera and traffic smears."
msgstr ""
"El DLAA segueix cada cosa en moviment per separat (trànsit, rodes, matrícules), així es manté "
"nítid i sense rastres. Desactiva-ho només per estalviar uns 0,5 ms per ull o per provar: tot es "
"mou amb la càmera i el trànsit s'esborra."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Smooths the truck mirrors too, so they do not shimmer. 1 mirror = only the largest (the main "
"mirror next to you). all = every mirror. camera = cheapest per mirror, moving traffic can leave "
"trails in the glass; the others follow each moving thing."
msgstr ""
"Suavitza també els retrovisors del camió, perquè no parpellegin. 1 retrovisor = només el més gran "
"(el principal al teu costat). tots = cada retrovisor. càmera = el més barat per retrovisor, el "
"trànsit en moviment pot deixar rastres al vidre; els altres segueixen cada cosa en moviment."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = each mirror gets its DLAA every 2nd frame and shows its last clean picture in between: about "
"half the mirror cost. Edges stay clean; moving things in the glass update at half rate. off = "
"every mirror every frame."
msgstr ""
"activat = cada retrovisor rep el DLAA cada 2 fotogrames i mostra la darrera imatge neta entre "
"mig: uns la meitat del cost. Vores netes; el que es mou al vidre s'actualitza a mitja taxa. "
"desactivat = cada retrovisor a cada fotograma."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Frame rate and CPU: CPU tuning, AMD cache cores, an FPS cap and Low delay (Reflex) for flat, an "
"FPS cap for VR. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Taxa de fotogrames i CPU: ajust de CPU, nuclis de memòria cau AMD, límit de fps i Baixa latència "
"(Reflex) en pla, límit de fps en VR. Dreta obre el grup, Esquerra el tanca; comença tancat cada "
"cop que s'obre el menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Three CPU switches together. Prefer fast cores: only Intel CPUs with P-cores and E-cores. Higher "
"priority and no Windows power saving for the game: every CPU, Intel and AMD. Helps when the CPU "
"is the limit; no cost. Separate in dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."
msgstr ""
"Tres interruptors de CPU junts. Preferir nuclis ràpids: només CPU Intel amb P-cores i E-cores. "
"Prioritat més alta i sense estalvi d'energia de Windows per al joc: totes les CPU, Intel i AMD. "
"Ajuda quan limita la CPU; sense cost. Per separat a dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, "
"cpu_no_throttle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"AMD X3D CPUs with two core groups (7950X3D, 9950X3D): keeps the game on the cores with the big 3D "
"V-Cache, which games like. Switches at once; off gives the game all cores back. Try it and "
"compare in a busy city. No cost."
msgstr ""
"CPU AMD X3D amb dos grups de nuclis (7950X3D, 9950X3D): manté el joc als nuclis amb la gran "
"V-Cache 3D, que als jocs els agrada. Canvia a l'instant; desactivat retorna tots els nuclis al "
"joc. Prova-ho i compara en una ciutat amb molt de trànsit. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only. Holds the game at most at this frame rate: a steady frame time, less heat and power. "
"Set it a bit below what your PC holds in a busy city. With Low delay (Reflex) on, the NVIDIA "
"driver does the limiting. off = no limit."
msgstr ""
"Només en pla. Manté el joc com a màxim a aquesta taxa: temps de fotograma estable, menys calor i "
"consum. Posa-ho una mica per sota del que el teu PC aguanta en una ciutat amb molt de trànsit. "
"Amb Baixa latència (Reflex) activada, limita el controlador NVIDIA. desactivat = sense límit."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only, NVIDIA only (NVIDIA Reflex). On = the game's frames wait less before the graphics card "
"draws them: less delay between your steering and the picture when the card is the limit. Boost "
"also keeps the card's clocks up. Same fps; small cost."
msgstr ""
"Només en pla, només NVIDIA (NVIDIA Reflex). Activat = els fotogrames del joc esperen menys abans "
"que la targeta gràfica els dibuixi: menys retard entre el volant i la imatge quan limita la "
"targeta. Boost també manté alts els rellotges de la targeta. Mateixos fps; cost petit."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. half = the game draws every 2nd headset frame (72 Hz -> 36 fps), third = every 3rd; the "
"headset's frame smoothing (ASW / Motion Smoothing) fills in the rest at a steady rhythm. Use it "
"when the fps swings. Turns Turbo off while on."
msgstr ""
"Només VR. meitat = el joc dibuixa un de cada 2 fotogrames del visor (72 Hz -> 36 fps), terç = un "
"de cada 3; el suavitzat del visor (ASW / Motion Smoothing) omple la resta a un ritme estable. "
"Fes-ho servir quan els fps oscil·len. Apaga el Turbo mentre és actiu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR speed-ups: Turbo, foveated rendering, skipping the hidden lens edges, and whether OFXR Bridge "
"/ VectorXR are found. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu "
"opens."
msgstr ""
"Acceleracions VR: Turbo, Foveated rendering, saltar les vores amagades de les lents i si es "
"troben OFXR Bridge / VectorXR. Dreta obre el grup, Esquerra el tanca; comença tancat cada cop que "
"s'obre el menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Turbo switches off the headset's frame smoothing (ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW). VR only. On = "
"the game stops waiting for the headset each frame: more fps only when the CPU is the limit (busy "
"cities, traffic). Turn it off if the picture judders."
msgstr ""
"El Turbo apaga el suavitzat de fotogrames del visor (ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW). Només VR. "
"Activat = el joc deixa d'esperar el visor a cada fotograma: més fps només quan limita la CPU "
"(ciutats amb molt de trànsit). Desactiva-ho si la imatge fa sacsejades."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharp centre, lower detail at the edge (NVIDIA RTX only). Saves GPU time at high Scaling. VR "
"only. The outer ring gets one colour per 2 x 2 pixels; fences, grass and leaves keep full detail. "
"Turn it off if the edge looks blocky."
msgstr ""
"Centre nítid, menys detall a la vora (només NVIDIA RTX). Estalvia temps de GPU amb Escalat alt. "
"Només VR. L'anell exterior rep un color per cada 2 x 2 píxels; tanques, herba i fulles mantenen "
"tot el detall. Desactiva-ho si la vora es veu a blocs."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How big the sharp centre of Foveated rendering is, 10 - 100 % in 5 % steps: bigger = more of the "
"view sharp, less saving; smaller = more saving, lower detail starts closer to the middle. 80 % "
"(balanced) is the default; 90 = wide, 65 = narrow."
msgstr ""
"Quina mida té el centre nítid del Foveated rendering, 10 - 100 % en passos del 5 %: més gran = "
"més vista nítida, menys estalvi; més petit = més estalvi, el detall baix comença més a prop del "
"centre. 80 % (equilibrat) és el valor per defecte; 90 = ample, 65 = estret."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What Foveated rendering makes coarser. scene = the 3D world only (default). scene + lighting = "
"also the game's lighting, at the very edge only: more saving. Test it: look for blocky light or "
"shadow edges at the side of your view."
msgstr ""
"Què fa més gruixut el Foveated rendering. escena = només el món 3D (per defecte). escena + "
"il·luminació = també la il·luminació del joc, només a la vora extrema: més estalvi. Prova-ho: "
"busca vores de llum o ombra a blocs al costat de la teva vista."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How coarse the outer ring of Foveated rendering is. Normal = 1 colour per 2 x 2 pixels (default). "
"Strong = per 4 x 2, Max = per 4 x 4: more GPU saving, blockier edges. Best with eye tracking, "
"where you never look at the outer ring."
msgstr ""
"Quin gruix té l'anell exterior del Foveated rendering. Normal = 1 color per cada 2 x 2 píxels "
"(per defecte). Fort = per 4 x 2, Màx = per 4 x 4: més estalvi de GPU, vores més a blocs. El "
"millor amb seguiment ocular, on mai mires l'anell exterior."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental. The sharp centre of Foveated rendering follows your eyes on a headset with eye "
"tracking (for example Varjo); without it the centre stays in the middle of the lens. Needs "
"Foveated rendering on at the game's start, else a restart. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Experimental. El centre nítid del Foveated rendering segueix els teus ulls en un visor amb "
"seguiment ocular (per exemple Varjo); sense, es queda al centre de la lent. Cal el Foveated "
"rendering activat en iniciar el joc, si no, un reinici. Gairebé sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. The game skips the lens corners you never see (the headset reports them), so it draws "
"fewer pixels: more GPU headroom, the picture you see stays the same. The first switch-on needs a "
"game restart. Turn it off if the edge of the view looks wrong."
msgstr ""
"Només VR. El joc se salta les cantonades de la lent que mai veus (el visor les informa), dibuixa "
"menys píxels: més marge de GPU, la imatge que veus és la mateixa. La primera activació demana "
"reiniciar el joc. Desactiva-ho si la vora de la vista es veu estranya."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR frame generation by djules75, a separate download "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). found = its layer is loaded in this game and the mod lets its "
"work pass through. Start its tray app before the game."
msgstr ""
"OFXR Bridge = generació de fotogrames en VR de djules75, descàrrega a part "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). trobat = la seva capa està carregada en aquest joc i el mod "
"deixa passar la seva feina. Inicia la seva app de la safata abans del joc."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VectorXR = an OpenXR enhancement suite by DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"Depth, frame generation; found = its layer is loaded in the game and the mod lets its work pass "
"through. Run only one Turbo (its or the mod's)."
msgstr ""
"VectorXR = un conjunt de millores OpenXR de DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"profunditat, generació de fotogrames; trobat = la seva capa està carregada al joc i el mod deixa "
"passar la seva feina. Fes servir un sol Turbo (el seu o el del mod)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Where the game's own VR UI floats (HUD, menus). The mod types the change into the game's console "
"for you; needs g_developer and g_console 1 in config.cfg. Right opens the group, Left closes it."
msgstr ""
"On flota la IU VR pròpia del joc (HUD, menús). El mod escriu el canvi a la consola del joc per "
"tu; cal g_developer i g_console 1 a config.cfg. Dreta obre el grup, Esquerra el tanca."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Which of the game's VR UI layouts the rows below move: driving (the HUD while driving) or menus "
"(the game's menu screens)."
msgstr ""
"Quina de les disposicions de la IU VR del joc mouen les files de sota: conducció (el HUD mentre "
"condueixes) o menús (les pantalles de menú del joc)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the game's VR UI: height, side, distance, tilt, turn, size or curve, in small steps. The "
"game gets each change about 0.4 s after your last press: the console opens and closes by itself."
msgstr ""
"Mou la IU VR del joc: alçada, costat, distància, inclinació, gir, mida o corba, a petits passos. "
"El joc rep cada canvi uns 0,4 s després de l'última pulsació: la consola s'obre i es tanca sola."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Right: every value of both layouts back to what config.cfg had at the start (the game saves its "
"own values when it exits)."
msgstr ""
"Dreta: tots els valors de les dues disposicions tornen al que tenia config.cfg a l'inici (el joc "
"desa els seus valors en sortir)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"A small live fps and frame-time box, also while this menu is closed (flat and VR): fps, ms, "
"numbers only, each with or without a graph of recent frame times (spikes show red), or the graph "
"alone. Its GPU cost is measured. Save keeps it."
msgstr ""
"Un petit quadre en directe amb fps i temps de fotograma, també amb aquest menú tancat (pla i VR): "
"fps, ms, només números, cadascun amb o sense gràfic dels temps recents (els pics surten en "
"vermell), o només el gràfic. El seu cost de GPU està mesurat. Desar el conserva."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The fps box's lock, position, size, colour, VR distance and turn. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Fixació, posició, mida, color, distància VR i gir del quadre de fps. Dreta obre el grup, Esquerra "
"el tanca; comença tancat cada cop que s'obre el menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees around you). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Mou el quadre de fps als costats, en % de la pantalla (VR fix / enganxat: graus al teu voltant). "
"Pantalla plana i VR guarden cadascun la seva posició. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees, minus = up). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Mou el quadre de fps amunt / avall, en % de la pantalla (VR fix / enganxat: graus, menys = "
"amunt). Pantalla plana i VR guarden cadascun la seva posició. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes the fps box bigger or smaller (0.2 .. 3.0). Raise it if you cannot read it in the headset "
"or on a big screen. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Fa el quadre de fps més gran o més petit (0,2 .. 3,0). Puja-ho si no pots llegir-lo al visor o en "
"una pantalla gran. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The colour of the fps box's text: 20 colours, each with an outline so it reads on any picture "
"(black on white = dark text, white outline). Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"El color del text del quadre de fps: 20 colors, cadascun amb contorn per llegir-se sobre "
"qualsevol imatge (negre sobre blanc = text fosc, contorn blanc). Pla i VR. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How bright the fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = the colour as it is, lower dims the text (the "
"outline stays) toward black. Use it to tone the counter down at night or in the headset. Flat and "
"VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Brillantor del quadre de fps, 10 - 100 %: 100 = el color tal qual, menys enfosqueix el text (el "
"contorn es queda) cap al negre. Fes-ho servir per abaixar el comptador de nit o al visor. Pla i "
"VR. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How see-through the whole fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = solid, lower fades the text AND its black "
"outline together, so a dimmed box does not turn into a black blob. Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Com de translúcid és tot el quadre de fps, 10 - 100 %: 100 = sòlid, menys esvaeix el text I el "
"seu contorn negre alhora, perquè no es faci una taca negra. Pla i VR. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far back the fps graph shows: 2 - 60 s. One bar per slice of time = its slowest frame, so you "
"see spikes. Green = on time, yellow = a bit slow, red = a hitch; the line = the headset rate / "
"FPS cap / your usual. Shown when FPS counter has a graph."
msgstr ""
"Fins on arriba enrere el gràfic de fps: 2 - 60 s. Una barra per cada tros de temps = el seu "
"fotograma més lent, així veus els pics. Verd = a temps, groc = una mica lent, vermell = una "
"sacsejada; la línia = la taxa del visor / límit de fps / el teu habitual. Es mostra quan "
"Comptador de FPS té gràfic."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = moves with the headset. Fixed in play space = one spot around your seat, "
"ignores the cab's sway. Attached to vehicle = stuck to the cab, sways with it (needs DLAA + Track "
"moving parts). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Només VR. Seguir el cap = es mou amb el visor. Fix a l'espai de joc = un punt al voltant del teu "
"seient, ignora el balanceig de la cabina. Enganxat al vehicle = enganxat a la cabina, es "
"balanceja amb ella (necessita DLAA + Seguir peces mòbils). Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. On = each truck / car keeps its own fps box spot in the cab, turn, "
"size, colour, brightness and text (saved in dlaa.ini when the menu closes). Off = one shared set "
"for every vehicle. No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR, només Enganxat al vehicle. Activat = cada camió / cotxe conserva el lloc del seu quadre de "
"fps a la cabina, gir, mida, color, brillantor i text (es desa al dlaa.ini en tancar el menú). "
"Desactivat = un sol conjunt per a tots els vehicles. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. Right = measure the cab again now (sit still, parked) if the box "
"sits off. Left = this vehicle's box back to the defaults (spot, turn, size, colour, text); other "
"vehicles keep theirs. The box is square to the cab."
msgstr ""
"VR, només Enganxat al vehicle. Dreta = mesurar la cabina de nou ara (quiet, aparcat) si el quadre "
"queda fora de lloc. Esquerra = el quadre d'aquest vehicle torna al per defecte (lloc, gir, mida, "
"color, text); els altres vehicles conserven el seu. El quadre queda recte amb la cabina."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Turns the fps box left / right on itself, in degrees (+ = its face "
"turns to the right). Use it to angle the box when it sits at the side. 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Només VR, en gris en pantalla plana. Gira el quadre de fps a esquerra / dreta, en graus (+ = la "
"cara gira a la dreta). Fes-ho servir per orientar el quadre quan és al costat. 0 = et mira de "
"cara. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Tilts the fps box, in degrees (+ = its top leans away from you, as if "
"lying on the dashboard). 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Només VR, en gris en pantalla plana. Inclina el quadre de fps, en graus (+ = la part de dalt "
"s'allunya de tu, com estirat al panell). 0 = et mira de cara. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Rotates the fps box in its own plane, in degrees (+ = clockwise). 0 = "
"upright. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Només VR, en gris en pantalla plana. Gira el quadre de fps en el seu propi pla, en graus (+ = "
"sentit horari). 0 = dret. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the fps box floats, 0.30 - 3.00 m. It keeps the same "
"size in your view at every distance; only the depth changes. Put it near the depth you look at to "
"read it without refocusing. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Només VR, en gris en pantalla plana. A quina distància flota el quadre de fps, 0,30 - 3,00 m. "
"Manté la mateixa mida a la vista a qualsevol distància; només canvia la profunditat. Posa'l prop "
"de la profunditat on mires per llegir-lo sense reenfocar. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The panel's position, size, depth, facing and the menu keys. Right opens the group, Left closes "
"it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Posició, mida, profunditat i orientació del panell, i les tecles del menú. Dreta obre el grup, "
"Esquerra el tanca; comença tancat cada cop que s'obre el menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees around your seat). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Mou aquest panell als costats, en % de la pantalla (VR fix a la cabina: graus al voltant del "
"seient). Pantalla plana i VR guarden cadascun la seva posició. Fes-ho servir si el panell tapa "
"alguna cosa que necessites. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees, plus = down). Flat and "
"VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Mou aquest panell amunt / avall, en % de la pantalla (VR fix a la cabina: graus, més = avall). "
"Pantalla plana i VR guarden cadascun la seva posició. Fes-ho servir si el panell tapa alguna cosa "
"que necessites. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes this panel bigger or smaller. Raise it if you cannot read it, lower it if it covers too "
"much. Flat and VR each keep their own size. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Fa aquest panell més gran o més petit. Puja-ho si no pots llegir-lo, baixa-ho si tapa massa. "
"Pantalla plana i VR guarden cadascun la seva mida. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = the panel moves with the headset. Fixed in cab = it stays at one spot in "
"front of your seat, steady while you look around; X / Y / depth then set that spot (degrees, "
"metres). Needs the VR layer (default). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Només VR. Seguir el cap = el panell segueix el visor. Fix a la cabina = es queda en un punt "
"davant del teu seient, estable quan mires al voltant; X / Y / profunditat fixen aquest punt "
"(graus, metres). Cal la capa VR (per defecte). Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the panel floats: in metres (0.30 - 3.00) as a VR layer, "
"the default; in px of inward shift per eye with menu_vr_layer = 0. Same size at every depth. "
"Change it if the panel is tiring to look at. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Només VR, en gris en pantalla plana. A quina distància flota el panell: en metres (0,30 - 3,00) "
"com a capa VR, per defecte; en px de desplaçament per ull amb menu_vr_layer = 0. Mateixa mida a "
"qualsevol profunditat. Canvia-ho si cansa mirar-lo. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. On = the panel turns to face you when you move it to the side, same "
"size from every angle (as a VR layer, the default, the head-following fps box too); off = a flat "
"picture. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Només VR, en gris en pantalla plana. Activat = el panell es gira cap a tu quan el mous cap al "
"costat, mateixa mida des de qualsevol angle (com a capa VR, per defecte, també el quadre de fps "
"que segueix el cap); desactivat = imatge plana. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches for comparing: DLAA off, the game's own TAA mixed in or side by side, the wire fixes, "
"running DLAA earlier. Nothing here is needed for normal driving. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it."
msgstr ""
"Interruptors per comparar: DLAA desactivat, el TAA propi del joc barrejat o un al costat de "
"l'altre, els arranjaments de cables, DLAA abans. Res d'aquí no cal per conduir amb normalitat. "
"Dreta obre el grup, Esquerra el tanca."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches the whole mod on or off and keeps the mode; off shows the game's own picture, for "
"comparing. Off saves the cost of every part together."
msgstr ""
"Activa o desactiva tot el mod i en conserva el mode; desactivat mostra la imatge del joc, per "
"comparar. Desactivat estalvia el cost de totes les parts juntes."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = the mod on the left, the game's own TAA on the right, to compare (Split line position, "
"Split: left | right). Replaces Mix while on. With the game's console on, the mod switches the "
"game's Anti-aliasing for you."
msgstr ""
"on = el mod a l'esquerra, el TAA propi del joc a la dreta, per comparar (Posició de la línia, "
"Divisió: esq. | dreta). Substitueix la Mescla mentre està activat. Amb la consola del joc "
"activada, el mod canvia l'Antialiàsing del joc per tu."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Where the split line is, 0 - 100 % of the width in 5 % steps: the mod's DLAA / DLSS on the left "
"of it, the game's TAA on the right. Used only while Split with game TAA is on."
msgstr ""
"On és la línia de divisió, 0 - 100 % de l'amplada en passos del 5 %: a l'esquerra el DLAA / DLSS "
"del mod, a la dreta el TAA del joc. Només s'usa mentre Divisió amb TAA del joc està activat."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What the split shows on its two sides: DLAA | TAA (the mod left, the game's TAA right), Mix | TAA "
"or DLAA | Mix (Mix = the two blended at Mix amount). DLSS instead of DLAA when upscaling. Used "
"only while Split with game TAA is on."
msgstr ""
"Què mostra la divisió als seus dos costats: DLAA | TAA (el mod a l'esquerra, el TAA del joc a la "
"dreta), mescla | TAA o DLAA | mescla (mescla = les dues barrejades segons la Quantitat de "
"mescla). DLSS en lloc de DLAA en escalar. Només s'usa mentre Divisió amb TAA del joc està activat."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires move correctly while you drive: their movement is spread over the whole thin line. on "
"= default. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more. The picture is soft for a moment when "
"you switch."
msgstr ""
"Els cables fins es mouen bé mentre condueixes: el seu moviment s'escampa per tota la línia fina. "
"activat = per defecte. desactivat = només per comparar; els cables propers parpellegen més. La "
"imatge es veu tova un moment en canviar."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires count as in front on every pixel they touch, even where they cover only a sliver of "
"it. on = default. on (no A2C) = also for see-through edges such as leaves. off = only to compare; "
"near wires flicker more."
msgstr ""
"Els cables fins compten com a davant a cada píxel que toquen, fins i tot on en cobreixen només "
"una tira. activat = per defecte. activat (sense A2C) = també per a vores translúcides com les "
"fulles. desactivat = només per comparar; els cables propers parpellegen més."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental: draws far wires that are thinner than 1 pixel as a 1 pixel line, so they do not "
"break into dashes. Off by default: far wires may look darker or flicker more. Try it and compare."
msgstr ""
"Experimental: dibuixa els cables llunyans més fins d'1 píxel com a línia d'1 píxel, perquè no es "
"trenquin en trossos. Desactivat per defecte: els cables llunyans poden veure's més foscos o "
"parpellejar més. Prova-ho i compara."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only: DLAA runs before the game adds its glow and colour look, so lane paint, wires and "
"rails shimmer less. Change it only to compare. Not used with DLSS upscaling or Windows HDR. Same "
"cost either way; takes about a second to switch."
msgstr ""
"Només en pla: el DLAA s'executa abans que el joc afegeixi la seva resplendor i l'aspecte de "
"color, així les marques vials, cables i baranes parpellegen menys. Canvia-ho només per comparar. "
"No s'usa amb l'escalat DLSS ni amb HDR de Windows. Mateix cost en tots dos casos; triga un segon "
"a canviar."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Bug report: press the capture key twice (or Capture now) where something looks wrong; the mod "
"writes one zip you attach to a GitHub issue. Right opens the group, Left closes it."
msgstr ""
"Informe d'error: prem dues vegades la tecla de captura (o Captura ara) on alguna cosa es vegi "
"malament; el mod escriu un zip que adjuntes a una issue de GitHub. Dreta obre el grup, Esquerra "
"el tanca."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"One switch for the most complete report: log detail debug, rewind 2 s, capture Full. Off puts the "
"rows back as they were. Only this switch is saved; the forced values are never written to "
"dlaa.ini."
msgstr ""
"Un sol interruptor per a l'informe més complet: detall del registre debug, rebobinat 2 s, captura "
"Completa. Desactivat torna les files a com eren. Només aquest interruptor es desa; els valors "
"forçats mai s'escriuen a dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What goes into dlaa_inject.log: off = nothing; errors = failures only (default); warnings = + "
"problems worked around; info = + start-up and changes; debug = + statistics and timing "
"measurements (a little slower)."
msgstr ""
"Què entra a dlaa_inject.log: desactivat = res; errors = només fallades (per defecte); avisos = + "
"problemes esquivats; info = + inici i canvis; debug = + estadístiques i mesures de temps (una "
"mica més lent)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Keeps the last 0.5 - 3 s of frames on the graphics card all the time, so the report shows the "
"moment BEFORE the key (+ what DLSS got for the last frames). Costs graphics memory (the MB in the "
"cost column) and a picture copy per frame. off = none."
msgstr ""
"Guarda sempre a la targeta gràfica els últims 0,5 - 3 s de fotogrames, així l'informe mostra el "
"moment ABANS de la tecla (+ el que va rebre DLSS en els últims fotogrames). Gasta memòria gràfica "
"(els MB de la columna de cost) i una còpia d'imatge per fotograma. desactivat = cap."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Quick = system info, logs, settings, your picture and DLAA off for a few frames (about 1 s). Full "
"= + what DLSS got per frame (colour, motion, depth) and A/B sets: motion view, motion off, jitter "
"only (about 2 - 4 s)."
msgstr ""
"Ràpida = info del sistema, registres, ajusts, la teva imatge i DLAA desactivat uns fotogrames "
"(uns 1 s). Completa = + el que va rebre DLSS per fotograma (color, moviment, profunditat) i jocs "
"A/B: vista de moviment, sense moviment, només jitter (uns 2 - 4 s)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The capture key. Press it TWICE within 1 s while driving where it goes wrong (the first press "
"only arms it: one short beep). Right opens the Hotkeys page on its line to change it."
msgstr ""
"La tecla de captura. Prem-la DUES vegades en 1 s mentre condueixes on alguna cosa falli (la "
"primera pulsació només l'arma: un xiulet curt). Dreta obre la pàgina Dreceres a la seva línia per "
"canviar-la."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How many captures stay in the dlaa_selftest folder next to the DLL: older ones (folder + zip) are "
"deleted when a new one is written. all = never delete."
msgstr ""
"Quantes captures es queden a la carpeta dlaa_selftest al costat de la DLL: les més antigues "
"(carpeta + zip) s'esborren quan se n'escriu una de nova. totes = no esborrar mai."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The language of this menu. auto = the game's language (default); Left / Right picks another one. "
"Linux / Proton: Chinese, Japanese and Korean need their fonts installed, see the README. A "
"lang\\<code>.po file next to the DLL wins, for your own fixes. Save keeps it. No cost."
msgstr ""
"L'idioma d'aquest menú. auto = l'idioma del joc (per defecte); Esquerra / Dreta en tria un altre. "
"Linux / Proton: el xinès, japonès i coreà necessiten les seves fonts instal·lades, mira el "
"README. Un fitxer lang\\<code>.po al costat de la DLL té prioritat, per a les teves correccions. "
"Desar el conserva. Sense cost."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Every hotkey of this menu, one line per action, with its keyboard key and controller button. "
"Right opens the list; pick an action with Right, then press the new key or wheel button. Saved to "
"dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Totes les dreceres d'aquest menú, una línia per acció, amb la tecla del teclat i el botó del "
"comandament. Dreta obre la llista; tria una acció amb Dreta i prem la tecla o botó del volant "
"nou. Es desa al dlaa.ini a l'instant."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Writes everything shown here into dlaa.ini (settings, and the panel / fps box positions once you "
"moved them), keeping every other line. Do it once you like what you see, or the changes are gone "
"at the next start. Mode saves itself."
msgstr ""
"Escriu tot el que es veu aquí al dlaa.ini (ajustos, i les posicions del panell / quadre de fps un "
"cop mogudes), conservant les altres línies. Fes-ho quan t'agradi el resultat, o els canvis es "
"perden a l'inici següent. El mode es desa sol."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Puts every setting in this menu back to how the mod ships (model, sharpen, texture sharpness, "
"DLAA area, motion, mirrors, preset, panel, fps box, turbo, foveated, frame rate, CPU, log "
"detail), live and in dlaa.ini, keeping your hotkeys and every other line."
msgstr ""
"Torna cada ajust d'aquest menú a com ve el mod (model, nitidesa, nitidesa de textura, àrea DLAA, "
"moviment, retrovisors, perfil, panell, comptador fps, turbo, foveated, taxa de fotogrames, CPU, "
