#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%hs = capture now (the menu closes first). The zip (dlaa_selftest folder next to the DLL) holds "
"system info, the mod's and the game's log, dlaa.ini, your picture and DLAA off; Full adds what "
"DLSS got and the A/B sets; rewind adds the moment before. Your user name and home folder are "
"removed. %ls"
msgstr ""
"%hs = captura ara (abans es tanca el menú). El zip (carpeta dlaa_selftest al costat de la DLL) "
"conté info del sistema, el registre del mod i del joc, dlaa.ini, la teva imatge i DLAA "
"desactivat; Completa afegeix el que va rebre DLSS i els jocs A/B; el rebobinat afegeix el moment "
"anterior. El teu nom d'usuari i la carpeta personal s'eliminen. %ls"

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The 5 keys that open and drive this menu: %hs opens / closes it (the value), %hs / %hs / %hs / "
"%hs move (Hotkey column). While the menu is open only these 5 are kept from the game. %hs: change "
"them on the Hotkeys page."
msgstr ""
"Les 5 tecles que obren i porten aquest menú: %hs obre / tanca (el valor), %hs / %hs / %hs / %hs "
"mouen (columna Drecera). Amb el menú obert només aquestes 5 es retenen del joc. %hs: canvia-les a "
"la pàgina Dreceres."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Closes the menu; the 5 menu keys go back to the game. %hs does the same from any row."
msgstr "Tanca el menú; les 5 tecles del menú tornen al joc. %hs fa el mateix des de qualsevol fila."

#. Footer line (shortened automatically when too long)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid "keys: Hotkeys..."
msgstr "tecles: Dreceres..."

